p]] [[Cookbook:Chickpea Flour|besan]] (Bengal gram flour)\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] [[Cookbook:Asafoetida|asafoetida]] (hing)\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 1 tsp green chilli-ginger paste\n* 1 tbsp hot oil\n\n==Procedure==\n# Heat the oil for [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|deep frying]]. \n# Combine all remaining ingredients together in a bowl, and mix well. \n# Divide dough into 15–20 equal portions, and shape each into a round ball.\n# Fry the balls in hot oil in batches of 10–12 over a slow flame until they turn golden brown in colour.\n# Drain on an absorbent paper and serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using asafoetida]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fenugreek leaf]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile-ginger paste]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Deep Fried Wheat and Chickpea Flour Dough Balls (Muthiya)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Oil for deep frying","sourceText":"Oil for deep frying","amountText":"Oil for deep frying","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup chopped methi (fenugreek) leaves","sourceText":"1 cup chopped methi (fenugreek) leaves","amountText":"1 cup chopped methi (fenugreek) leaves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"⅓ cup whole wheat flour (gehun ka atta)","sourceText":"⅓ cup whole wheat flour (gehun ka atta)","amountText":"⅓ cup whole wheat flour (gehun ka atta)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tbsp besan (Bengal gram flour)","sourceText":"2 tbsp besan (Bengal gram flour)","amountText":"2 tbsp besan (Bengal gram flour)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 pinch asafoetida (hing)","sourceText":"1 pinch asafoetida (hing)","amountText":"1 pinch asafoetida (hing)","amount"